WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.469
Lab 2 needs one Windows 11 test device,
joined to Entra ID and enrolled in Intune,

2
00:00:05.469 --> 00:00:09.138
with the client installed
from the guide's Intune app.

3
00:00:09.138 --> 00:00:11.333
On the device, open the health check,

4
00:00:11.333 --> 00:00:14.287
then run the device script
as an administrator.

5
00:00:14.287 --> 00:00:17.475
Run the guide's own reads
beside it as a cross-check.

6
00:00:17.475 --> 00:00:20.975
Add the record to your
inputs, on agency storage.

7
00:00:20.975 --> 00:00:23.287
Then read the fleet's count and check.

8
00:00:23.287 --> 00:00:27.573
If the service reports no active
devices while the client is connected,

9
00:00:27.573 --> 00:00:32.075
record it: it may be the traffic type
parameter Learn's table marks required.

10
00:00:32.075 --> 00:00:35.113
Nothing changed, so
backing out is signing out.

11
00:00:35.113 --> 00:00:37.180
The authors haven't run this lab.
